  "description": "CyphalSharp is a lightweight, high-performance .NET library for parsing and encoding Cyphal (formerly UAVCAN) messages using DSDL definitions. It is extremely fast, flexible, and easy to use, and provides tools for constructing and encoding Cyphal packets for transmission over any communication protocol.",
  "id": "CyphalSharp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-04T16:43:33.233Z",
