  "published": "2026-10-04T16:40:49.623Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Corrected the Cyphal/CAN identifier layout to match OpenCyphal specification sections 4.2 and 4.3, including the service marker, request/response bit, service-ID, subject-ID, and reserved-bit placement.\n\t\t\t- Corrected the multi-frame toggle bit sequence, which now starts at one as the specification requires.\n\t\t\t- Corrected the transfer CRC byte order on reception to most-significant byte first.\n\t\t\t- Discard received frames whose reserved identifier bits are set instead of misinterpreting them.\n\t\t\t- Added byte-exact conformance tests derived from the specification's worked examples.",
